{# twig template #}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block page_title %}{{ 'Learn about Clean Gutter Company.' }}{% endblock %}
{% block page_meta_description %}{{ 'Learn about Clean Gutter Company.' }}{% endblock %}

{% block page_content %}

    {% embed 'layouts/right-sidebar.html.twig' %}

        {% block layout_header_left %}
            {% include 'components/header/logo.html.twig' %}
        {% endblock %}

        {% block layout_header_middle %}{% endblock%}

        {% block layout_header_right %}
            {% include 'components/header/call-now.html.twig' %}
        {% endblock %}

        {% block layout_page_title %}A Better Way to Clean Gutters{% endblock %}

        {% block layout_main_content %}

            <div class="col-12">

                <p>Every year, hundreds of thousands of ladder-related injuries are treated in emergency rooms across the United States. We think there should be a safer way to clean gutters.</p>

                <p>That's why we use <a class="text-link" href="" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#vacuum-vid-modal">commercial vacuum equipment</a> that allows us to clean gutters from the ground whenever possible. Our system can reach gutters up to three stories high without anyone walking on your roof.</p>

                <p>Our equipment is powerful enough to remove leaves, pine needles, mud, and even small root systems from neglected gutters. We've seen trees growing in gutters more than once.</p>

                <p>We believe maintaining your home shouldn't come with unnecessary risk. Our goal is to provide a safer, cleaner approach to gutter maintenance while treating your home with the same care and respect we'd expect for our own.</p>

                <p>As a veteran-owned business, we believe in showing up when we say we will, treating your property with respect, and doing the job right. Those values guide every service call we make.</p>

                <p>If you're looking for a safer, modern approach to gutter cleaning, <a class="text-link" href="tel:1-{{ company_phone | replace({'(': '', ') ': '-'}) }}">give us a call</a>. We'd appreciate the opportunity to earn your business.</p>

            </div>

        {% endblock %}

        {% block layout_sbr %}
            {% include 'components/forms/quote-request.html.twig' %}
            <div class="w-100 mb-3"></div>
            {% include 'components/testimonials.html.twig' %}
        {% endblock %}

    {% endembed %}

    {% include 'components/modals/vacuum-video.html.twig' %}

{% endblock %}
